# What EAS Build uploads. EAS archives the whole repository root for a
# monorepo, and once this file exists it REPLACES .gitignore for that purpose —
# so everything .gitignore keeps out has to be repeated in the first block.
#
# Why it exists: without it the archive was 3.3 GB against EAS's 2.0 GB limit
# (2026-10-04). EAS does not read .git/info/exclude, which is where
# .claude/worktrees (other checkouts of this same repo, ~17 GB) is ignored
# locally, and it does not skip .git (2.1 GB) either.
#
# A cloud build needs: the root manifests, pnpm-lock.yaml, and packages/*
# source. It does not need history, other checkouts, docs, goldens or tests.

# ---- 1. Mirror of .gitignore (keep in step when that file changes) ----------
node_modules/
dist/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
reports/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.pnpm-store/
.idea/
.DS_Store
.github/.token
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.tooling/
.vercel/
.superpowers/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.playwright-mcp/
.golden-out/

# ---- 2. From packages/client-react-native/.gitignore ------------------------
.expo/
*.log
web-build/
packages/client-react-native/ios/
packages/client-react-native/android/
packages/client-react-native/shots/
packages/client-react-native/report.xml
.maestro/

# ---- 3. Not needed to build the app -----------------------------------------
# History and other checkouts of this repo.
.git/
.claude/
.remember/
# Documentation, design prototypes (LFS), decks.
/docs/
/specs/
# Committed screenshots: 326 MB of web goldens, 11 MB of RN goldens.
packages/ui-contract/goldens/
packages/client-react-native/tests/visual/__screenshots__/
# CI config. (The root tests/ workspace stays: it is a pnpm workspace member,
# so the frozen lockfile needs its package.json, and it is under 1 MB.)

.github/
